   |
15 |         .main(|ctl, _files| {
   |                ---
   |                |
   |                `ctl` is a reference that is only valid in the closure body
   |                has type `&mut ScopedControl<'1>`
16 |             *STASH.lock().unwrap() = Some(std::mem::replace(ctl, Control::new()?));
   |                                                                  ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
   |                                                                  |
   |                                                                  `ctl` escapes the closure body here
